<title>ISRAEL: Dead Sea Works' 1996 EPS 0.45 shekel.</title>
<headline>Dead Sea Works' 1996 EPS 0.45 shekel.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Dead Sea Works Ltd.</p>
<p>			    (in millions of shekels except EPS)</p>
<p>			  Q4 96	Q4 95	12-MTH 96  12-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		 301.0	292.0	  1,114.0    1,177.8</p>
